  "title": "死磕一份经纪合同  (Lawyers Tied Up Over One Contract)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back at Xingtian, Xingzi and Kaiwen wait impatiently for a contract reply from a major talent agency, only to learn that Xin Huimei's demanding negotiations have tied up every lawyer in town. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "全明星计划回复是还没发过来吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我都已经催了，现在整个经纪团队全都在辛惠美签约的事上。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我认识的人，居然全都没空理我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "多大牌艺人没签过呀，至于的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这一次众筹成立基金会的事，已经把业内全都吓怕了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "一份经纪合同，整个律师团队在那儿死磕。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那么多人居然腾不出来一个律师来给我们起草合同。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "咱们走到哪儿她跟到哪儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "现在只能等着。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "尴尬又不失礼貌地微笑地等着。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "全明星计划回复是还没发过来吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Has the reply on the All-Star project still not come through?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我都已经催了，现在整个经纪团队全都在辛惠美签约的事上。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have already chased them; right now their entire management team is consumed with signing Xin Huimei.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我认识的人，居然全都没空理我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Every contact I know over there actually has zero time to deal with me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "多大牌艺人没签过呀，至于的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They have signed plenty of big stars before—does it really warrant all this?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这一次众筹成立基金会的事，已经把业内全都吓怕了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This time, crowdfunding to set up a foundation has thoroughly rattled the whole industry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "一份经纪合同，整个律师团队在那儿死磕。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Over a single agency contract, their entire team of lawyers is grinding away nonstop.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那么多人居然腾不出来一个律师来给我们起草合同。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With all those staff, they cannot even free up one lawyer to draft our contract.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "咱们走到哪儿她跟到哪儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everywhere we turn, she seems to be right in our path.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "现在只能等着。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right now all we can do is wait.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "尴尬又不失礼貌地微笑地等着。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Waiting with an awkward yet polite smile.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
